      "value": "In addition, I can also see the Groups to which a player belongs in the VRChat game by selecting the player's profile -> \"Groups\" -> \"View All\".\n\nI would like to be able to hide this as well.\n\nJapanese\n\n加えて、VRChatのゲーム内でも、プレイヤーのプロフィール -> \"GROUPS\" -> \"View All\" を選ぶと、所属Groupを見ることが出来ます。\n\nこちらも一緒に非表示にできるようにしてほしいです。",
